arch components (including SA) on ITC-2007, reporting strong Pareto-front q=
uality. This suggests that hybridisation can improve feasibility and soluti=
on quality. Moreover, surveys highlight the need for standardised benchmark=
ing to enable fair comparisons [<a href=3D"https://dl.acm.org/doi/full/10.1=
145/3793811.3793816#Bib0014" role=3D"doc-biblioref" data-xml-rid=3D"Bib0014=
" id=3D"core-Bib0014-3">14</a>]. Motivated by these gaps, we implement and =
evaluate a GA+SA hybrid using ITC-2007 (and scalable variants) to provide r=
eproducible baselines and comparative evidence against standalone GA and SA=
.</div><div role=3D"paragraph">In summary, this section reviews the strengt=
