uate whether combining GA=E2=80=99s exploration with SA=E2=80=99s exploitat=
ion can develop a more effective timetable optimisation strategy under real=
-world-like constraints.</div><section id=3D"sec-4-1"><h3>4.1 Benchmark</h3=
