related to the difference value of solution degradation and the current tem=
perature T. Otherwise, it is accepted with probability <i>e</i><sup>=E2=88=
=92 <i>=CE=B4</i>/<i>T</i></sup>, where <i>=CE=B4</i> =3D <i>f</i>(<i>n</i>=
